        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The definition of 'crime' in this context is distinct from common public understanding.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a more serious or legally significant form of wrongdoing beyond standard criminal definitions.",
